sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor User
participant Addin as Outlook add-in
participant Outlook as Outlook calendar
participant Moderator
participant Microsoft as Microsoft Entra / Graph
participant DB as Moderator database
participant Renewal as EventBridge + Lambda

    User->>Addin: Connect calendar sync
    Addin->>Moderator: Start OAuth (PKCE)
    Moderator-->>User: Microsoft sign-in and consent
    Microsoft-->>Moderator: OAuth callback
    Moderator->>Microsoft: Exchange code, create subscription
    Microsoft-->>Moderator: Tokens and subscription ID
    Moderator->>DB: Store encrypted connection and subscription

    User->>Addin: Add meeting
    Addin->>Moderator: Create ACTIVE conference
    Moderator->>DB: Save room, user, and server
    Moderator-->>Addin: Meeting URL
    Addin->>Outlook: Set URL, saveAsync(), get event ID
    Addin->>Moderator: Link converted event ID
    Moderator->>DB: Store event ID

    User->>Outlook: Cancel or delete appointment
    Outlook->>Microsoft: Calendar change
    Microsoft->>Moderator: Subscription notification
    Moderator->>DB: Match event ID, mark cancelled if deleted/cancelled

    loop Every 30 minutes
        Renewal->>DB: Find expiring subscriptions or missed notifications
        Renewal->>Microsoft: Renew/recreate, reconcile missed changes
        Renewal->>DB: Save subscription and cancellation updates
    end